<title>USA: Southwest Air gears up for corp debt landing.</title>
<headline>Southwest Air gears up for corp debt landing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Airlines Co is expected to whisk into the corporate debt arena with a $100 million debt offering via Lehman Brothers, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The A3/A-minus rated 30-year debt issue is expected to carry a make-whole call at 20 basis points over U.S. Treasuries, sources said.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
